<title>USA: Genicom buys Texas Instruments unit.</title>
<headline>Genicom buys Texas Instruments unit.</headline>
<dateline>CHANTILLY, Va. 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Genicom Corp said Wednesday it has closed its acquisition of a unit of Texas Instruments Inc for about $27 million.</p>
<p>The unit is devoted to printer and related supplies.</p>
<p>The unit's businesses include mid-range laser products, high-end serial products, automated ticket processing systems for the transportation industry, and supplies for each of the respective product lines.</p>
<p>The deal does not include any of Texas Instruments' facilities or manufacturing operations.</p>
</text>
